    "value": "<!-- tll-share-v1 (G09/G10): Make my card share flow + Who gets to see this panel. Mounts itself after the map's share bar for members only; public view untouched. Source: src/site-layers/tll-share-v1.js, bundle pinned to commit 725d85a (9 Oct 2026: no stray null under the layout toggle; the panel says the /p/ link page is not live yet, G11). Reads tllStates from localStorage (synced by the map), writes only the share-* custom fields. -->\n<script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/carleton71192/thatlayoverlife@725d85ac3691013dcc16850bb7ef5fe87b8235a6/dist/tll-share-v1.min.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>"
